Hi all

=20

            Iam working on Bridging code in linux 2.4.20 kernel. I just
want to know whether this bridge works with two different kinds of
interfaces attached to bridge.

=20

Like

=20

1.       a bridge with 802.3 interface and 802.5 interface

2.       a bridge with 802.3 interface and 802.16 interface(wireless).

=20

I think the present bridge code in linux 2.4.20 kernel doesn't support
this kind of bridging and this code doesn't do the protocol conversions
necessary. I just want to confirm.

=20

=20

Eagerly Waiting for reply

Vikram.



